            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Start exercise below to start the mic and the backing track: Am7, D7, then two bars of Gmaj7. Hold {{4}} on \"oo\" through Am7 and D7. At the end of the D7 bar, sing the run {{1}} {{2}} {{3}} on \"ah\" and land on {{3}} as Gmaj7 arrives.\nThen come from above: sing the run {{5}} {{4}} {{3}} into the same note."
          },
